OL,3,ABlink-182 to make Download debut as
OL,4,A2027 festival headliners
OL,5,
OL,6,FBlink-182, Evanescence & Bring Me The
OL,7,FHorizon have been announced as
OL,8,Fheadliners of next year's Download
OL,9,FFestival.
OL,11,FThe trio are among more than 100 rock
OL,12,Fand metal acts set to play the event at
OL,13,FDonington Park, Leicestershire from 9
OL,14,Fto 13 June.
OL,16,FOther acts on the bill include The
OL,17,FProdigy, 5 Seconds of Summer and a
OL,18,Fspecial performance by heavy metal
OL,19,Flegends Motley Crue.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
