OL,3,ABlink-182 to make Download debut as
OL,4,A2027 festival headliners
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS pop-punk band Blink-182 will be
OL,7,Fmaking their Download debut, while
OL,8,FEvanescence will become the festival's
OL,9,Fsecond female-fronted headliner.
